     3740     assign
     3741       f-curr-abbr = X_currency.curr-abbr
     3742       .
     3743     display
     3744       f-curr-abbr
     3745       tt-fin-doc.curr-code
     3746       with frame Dialog-Frame.
     3747     .
     3748     if tt-fin-doc.curr-code <> v-curr-code then
     3749     do:
     3750       run recalc in this-procedure("curr-code":U) no-error.
     3751       if error-status:error then
